{"data":{"body":"[P2] Include the default inference profile in the permission requirement\n\nThe example uses `llm()` without configuration, whose default model ID names a global inference profile. Both `BedrockConfig` and `docs/ai.md` specify that `bedrock:InvokeModel` is required on that profile as well as the model. A role granting access only to the model will encounter an access-denied error. Include the profile permission here and clarify that the default requires it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM8AAAABFnIJ-g","finding_digest":"a6f9761fb2f6f3bbc113e5a2588d6a7883f80522917aa1d955cbe1cf22e22375","finding_id":"arf_v1_u34xmh5s63z3xqit4wrfrdlkpc","finding_key":"extensions/readme.md::llm::missing-inference-profile-permission","identity_key":"extensions/readme.md::llm::missing-inference-profile-permission","line":330,"observation_digest":"4001f882b957db2d166854312a459471e61185f5828b77b9c946478dc53844c4","observation_id":"aro_v1_iaa7ravzk7ns2ftikqysurmuoh","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-extensions/README.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-23T20:24:58Z","review_id":"arr_v1_crpujvmgdgjo72qhzcfi7i5cit","reviewed_base_sha":"28b37ffab2e88c90251e9061288820876dc46a3e","reviewed_head_sha":"dfbc0e2bd6c64231106ae9257764388a6075d854","reviewer":"codex","start_line":330,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_hynxanlnmvtoeem2go3kmiox7o"},"pull_request":{"number":983},"record_id":"art_v1_2257d2sxscayffd454bo4suq2x","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-23T20:24:58Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
